* c0002-size00-0 | condition S5
Ipz pzn pzp SINE(0 0.0001 200)
Cpz pzp pzn 3.25e-08
Rpz pzp pzn 2e+07
RL out 0 150000
Ictl1 out 0 5e-07
Ictl2 out 0 5e-07
C1 0 out 1.5271e-06
D1 0 pzn DSCH
D2 0 pzp DSCH
D3 n1 out DSCH
D4 n2 out DSCH
D5 0 out DZ33
L1 n1 n3 0.00093513 Rser=6.67565
L2 n2 n4 0.00091565 Rser=6.57825
S1 n3 pzp G2_g 0 SWI
S2 n4 pzn G1_g 0 SWI
VG1 G1_g 0 PULSE(0 1 5.95272e-05 100n 100n 2.02349e-05 0.005)
VG2 G2_g 0 PULSE(0 1 0.00232078 100n 100n 4.20639e-05 0.005)
Rbleed_pzp pzp 0 1G
Rbleed_pzn pzn 0 1G
Rbleed_n1 n1 0 1G
Rbleed_n2 n2 0 1G
Rbleed_n3 n3 0 1G
Rbleed_n4 n4 0 1G
.model DSCH D(Is=5e-8 Rs=1 N=1.05 Cjo=10p BV=30 IBV=1u EG=0.69 XTI=2)
